      "help": {
        "1": "Add the two squeezes together.",
        "2": "Two hurdles in a row: you have to clear both. Total height is the sum.",
        "3": "Example: 20 Ω + 30 Ω = 50 Ω.",
        "4": "Watch: 20 + {Rd}. Type that number in."
